cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "DP-ECG: differential privacy on raw ECG signals"
abstract: >-
  Code and aggregated results for an empirical study of the privacy-utility
  trade-off when data-level differential privacy is applied directly to raw
  electrocardiogram signals rather than to model gradients.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/WIMUniCologne/dp-ecg-privacy-utility"
